"Adding an Instance Type creates a new Library item category. Multiple "
"Layouts can be added to an Instance Type and these Layouts can have "
"different Nodes attached. The Instance provisioning wizard will present "
"the Layout options compatible with the selected Cloud. If Cloud selection"
" is turned off, all Layouts will be presented for all Cloud types "
"accessible by the User."
msgstr ""
"Adding an Tipo de instancia creates a new Library item category. Multiple"
" Layouts puede ser added to an Tipo de instancia and these Layouts can "
"have different Nodes attached. The Instancia provisioning wizard will "
"present the Layout options compatible with the selected Nube. If Nube "
"selection is turned off, all Layouts will be presented for all Nube types"
" accessible by the Usuario."

